  "honest_framing": "MEASURED only. oracle_row and best_single_oracle leak the held-out labels and are reported strictly as UPPER BOUNDS, never as methods. All learned routers are fitted leave-one-metal-out, so their AUC is cross-metal. K is fixed at 10; the K-curve is FU4. DISPATCH and COMBINATION are judged separately: `uniform_avg` does not route, it averages, so crediting it to G3 would conflate the routing question with the ensembling line (FU2). Significance is the project standard (paired one-sided t, Holm across the family); the seed spread is reported as context, not as the gate."
